    "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>Links a browser would run as script, however the scheme is written:</p><ul><li><a href=\"javascript:alert(1)\">plain</a></li><li><a href=\"JavaScript:alert(1)\">mixed case</a></li><li><a href=\"JAVASCRIPT:alert(1)\">upper case</a></li><li><a href=\" javascript:alert(1)\">leading space</a></li><li><a href=\"&#9;javascript:alert(1)\">leading tab</a></li><li><a href=\"java&#9;script:alert(1)\">tab inside</a></li><li><a href=\"java&#10;script:alert(1)\">newline inside</a></li><li><a href=\"java&#13;script:alert(1)\">carriage return inside</a></li><li><a href=\"  JaVa&#9;ScRiPt:alert(1)\">all of them</a></li><li><a href=\"VBScript:msgbox(1)\">vbscript</a></li></ul><p>and links that are not script: <a href=\"http://example.org/javascript:alert(1)\">a path</a>, <a href=\"#javascript\">an anchor</a></p><a name=\"javascript\"> </a></div>"
